  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As, gravitational constant,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>G</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Planck&#39;s constant, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>G</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Velocity of light, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>LT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo></math> length</p>",
